## Quickstart

Prerequisites: Python {{ python_version }}+ and git. Docker is optional (for `docker-build`).
Or open the folder in VS Code and choose **Reopen in Container**.

```bash
# Linux / macOS
make setup
make check
make run        # http://127.0.0.1:8000/docs
```

```powershell
# Windows (PowerShell)
./dev.ps1 setup
./dev.ps1 check
./dev.ps1 run   # http://127.0.0.1:8000/docs
```

Run `make help` or `./dev.ps1 help` to list all commands.

